      <h1>Manulife Coverage for Wellness Care <em>Paramedical Benefits, Claims and Spending Accounts</em></h1>
      <p>This guide explains how Manulife group benefits usually treat the wellness care listed on WellFinder, from naturopath visits to physiotherapy and massage therapy. It covers claiming in the Manulife Mobile app and on the plan member site, direct billing through providers, and the spending accounts many Manulife plans include.</p>
      <p>Your employer chose the details of your plan, so the categories and amounts that apply to you live in your own coverage. Sign in and read your balances before you book, and use this guide to know what to look for.</p>
      <p class="byline">By WellFinder · November 2026 · 5 min read</p>
    </div>
      </div>

  </section>

